    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Forwarded /s (1m)",
      "description": "Messages crossing the boundary per second, averaged over 1m. Computed by Prometheus from the monotonic counter \u2014 the bridge exports no windowed metric of its own, so these stay correct across restarts and multiple replicas.",
